  ('part', 'part', 'pɑ:t', E'n. 部分, 局部, 零件, 要素, 等分, 职责, 角色, 部位\nvt. 分开, 分离, 断绝, 区别, 分配\nvi. 分开, 断裂, 分手\na. 部分的, 局部的\nadv. 部分地, 有些', E'n. something determined in relation to something that includes it\nn. something less than the whole of a human artifact\nn. a portion of a natural object\nn. that which concerns a person with regard to a particular role or situation', '', 3, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,ky,ielts}', 140, 178, 's:parts/d:parted/p:parted/i:parting/3:parts'),
