  ('happen', 'happen', '''hæpәn', 'vi. 发生, 发生, 恰巧', E'v. come to pass\nv. happen, occur, or be the case in the course of events or by chance\nv. chance to be or do something, without intention or causation\nv. come into being; become reality', '', 5, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,ky}', 275, 216, 'p:happened/3:happens/d:happened/i:happening'),
