  ('political', 'political', 'pә''litikl', E'a. 政治的, 政治上的, 政党的, 从事政治的\n[法] 政治的, 政治上的, 党派政治的', E'a. involving or characteristic of politics or parties or politicians\na. of or relating to your views about social relationships involving authority or power\na. of or relating to the profession of governing', '', 5, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,ielts}', 292, 277, ''),
