  ('produce', 'produce', 'prә''dju:s', E'n. 生产品, 物产, 后代\nvt. 产生, 生产, 提出, 出示\nvi. 生产, 制造', E'n. fresh fruits and vegetable grown for the market\nv. bring forth or yield\nv. create or manufacture a man-made product\nv. cause to happen, occur or exist', '', 5, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,gre}', 296, 542, 'd:produced/p:produced/i:producing/3:produces'),
