  ('general', 'general', '''dʒenәrәl', E'n. 一般, 将军, 大体\na. 全面的, 大体的, 总的, 一般的, 普遍的\nn. 常规\n[计] 常规', E'n. a general officer of the highest rank\nn. the head of a religious order or congregation\nn. a fact about the whole (as opposed to particular)\nv. command as a general', '', 5, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 301, 804, 's:generals'),
