  ('reality', 'reality', 'ri''æliti', E'n. 实在, 事实, 实体, 逼真\n[法] 现实, 实在存在的事物, 实在性', E'n. the state of being actual or real\nn. the state of the world as it really is rather than as you might want it to be\nn. the quality possessed by something that is real', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky}', 1299, 1032, 's:realities'),
  ('coach', 'coach', 'kәutʃ', E'n. 四轮大马车, 教练\nvt. 训练, 指导\nvi. 坐马车旅行, 作指导', E'n. (sports) someone in charge of training an athlete or a team\nn. a person who gives private instruction (as in singing, acting, etc.)\nn. a carriage pulled by four horses with one driver\nv. teach and supervise (someone); act as a trainer or coach (to), as in sports', '', 4, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 2347, 1033, 's:coaches/i:coaching/d:coached/p:coached/3:coaches'),
  ('means', 'means', 'mi:nz', E'n. 方法, 手段, 工具, 财产, 收入\n[经] 方法, 手段, 工具; 意谓', E'n. how a result is obtained or an end is achieved\nn. an instrumentality for accomplishing some end\nn. considerable capital (wealth or income)', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 1033, null, '0:mean/1:3'),
  ('notice', 'notice', '''nәutis', E'n. 注意, 布告, 通知, 预告, 短评\nvt. 注意, 通知, 评论, 提及, 关注\nvi. 注意', E'n. an announcement containing information about an event\nn. the act of noticing or paying attention\nn. advance notification (usually written) of the intention to withdraw from an arrangement of contract\nn. polite or favorable attention', '', 4, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 1034, 1044, 'p:noticed/d:noticed/i:noticing/s:notices/3:notices')
