  ('nuclear', 'nuclear', '''nju:kliә', E'a. 核子的, 原子能的, 核的, 中心的\n[医] 核的', E'a. (weapons) deriving destructive energy from the release of atomic energy\na. of or relating to or constituting the nucleus of an atom\na. of or relating to or constituting the nucleus of a cell\ns. constituting or like a nucleus', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 1221, 1176, ''),
