  ('conflict', 'conflict', '''kɒnflikt', E'n. 战斗, 冲突, 矛盾, 争执\nvi. 争执, 战斗, 冲突, 抵触\n[计] 冲突', E'n. an open clash between two opposing groups (or individuals)\nn. opposition between two simultaneous but incompatible feelings\nn. a state of opposition between persons or ideas or interests\nn. an incompatibility of dates or events', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts,gre}', 1364, 1179, 's:conflicts/p:conflicted/i:conflicting/3:conflicts/d:conflicted'),
