  ('doubt', 'doubt', 'daut', E'n. 怀疑, 疑惑\nv. 怀疑, 不信', E'n. the state of being unsure of something\nn. uncertainty about the truth or factuality or existence of something\nv. consider unlikely or have doubts about\nv. lack confidence in or have doubts about', '', 4, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 1183, 1906, 's:doubts/p:doubted/d:doubted/i:doubting/3:doubts'),
