  ('fan', 'fan', 'fæn', E'n. 风扇, 迷, 狂热者, 爱好者\nvt. 煽动, 刺激, 吹拂\nvi. 飘动, 成扇形散开', E'n. a device for creating a current of air by movement of a surface or surfaces\nn. an ardent follower and admirer\nv. strike out (a batter), (of a pitcher)\nv. make (an emotion) fiercer', '', 4, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky}', 1905, 1208, 's:fans/i:fanning/p:fanned/d:fanned/3:fans'),
