  ('stick', 'stick', 'stik', E'n. 棍, 棒, 刺, 枯枝, 茎, 条状物\nvt. 插进, 刺入, 钉住, 伸出, 粘贴, 停止\nvi. 粘住, 停留, 坚持, 陷住, 伸出', E'n. an implement consisting of a length of wood\nn. a small thin branch of a tree\nn. a lever used by a pilot to control the ailerons and elevators of an airplane\nn. a rectangular quarter pound block of butter or margarine', '', 3, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 1545, 1209, 'p:stuck/i:sticking/d:stuck/s:sticks/3:sticks'),
