  ('resident', 'resident', '''rezidәnt', E'n. 居民, 常驻程序, 居住者, 留鸟\na. 居留的, 定居的', E'n. someone who lives at a particular place for a prolonged period or who was born there\na. living in a particular place', '', 4, true, '{cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,gre}', 2053, 1254, 's:residents'),
