  ('desire', 'desire', 'di''zaiә', E'n. 欲望, 要求\nvt. 想要, 请求\nvi. 渴望', E'n. the feeling that accompanies an unsatisfied state\nn. an inclination to want things\nn. something that is desired\nv. feel or have a desire for; want strongly', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 1629, 1551, 's:desires/d:desired/p:desired/3:desires/i:desiring'),
  ('leading', 'leading', '''li:diŋ', E'n. 领导, 指挥, 神示, 铅板\na. 领导的, 主要的, 在前的', E's. indicating the most important performer or role\ns. greatest in importance or degree or significance or achievement\na. going or proceeding or going in advance; showing the way', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 1551, 2188, '0:lead/1:i/i:leading'),
  ('reduction', 'reduction', 'ri''dʌkʃәn', E'n. 减少, 缩影, 变化\n[化] 还原', E'n. any process in which electrons are added to an atom or ion (as by removing oxygen or adding hydrogen); always occurs accompanied by oxidation of the reducing agent\nn. the act of reducing complexity', '', 3, true, '{cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 1554, 2270, 's:reductions'),
  ('paint', 'paint', 'peint', E'n. 油漆, 颜料, 绘画作品, 涂漆\nvt. 油漆, 绘, 画, 描绘, 装饰, 点缀\nvi. 绘画, 涂漆', E'n. a substance used as a coating to protect or decorate a surface (especially a mixture of pigment suspended in a liquid); dries to form a hard coating\nv. make a painting\nv. apply paint to; coat with paint\nv. make a painting of', '', 4, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,ky}', 2040, 1555, 'd:painted/p:painted/i:painting/s:paints/3:paints'),
