  ('recommend', 'recommend', '.rekә''mend', E'vt. 推荐, 介绍, 劝告, 使受欢迎, 托付\n[经] 建议, 推荐', E'v. push for something\nv. make attractive or acceptable', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 1578, 1688, 'd:recommended/p:recommended/3:recommends/i:recommending'),
