  ('urban', 'urban', '''ә:bәn', E'a. 都市的, 住在都市的, 习惯于都市的\n[法] 城市的, 都市的, 市区的', E'a. relating to or concerned with a city or densely populated area\na. located in or characteristic of a city or city life', '', 3, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 1749, 1583, ''),
