  ('resolution', 'resolution', '.rezә''lu:ʃәn', E'n. 解析, 决心, 坚定, 决定, 决议, 消除, 解答, 分解\nn. 图形分辨率\n[计] 图形分辨率', E'n. a formal expression by a meeting; agreed to by a vote\nn. finding a solution to a problem\nn. analysis into clear-cut components\nn. (computer science) the number of pixels per square inch on a computer-generated display; the greater the resolution, the better the picture', '', 4, false, '{cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 2064, 1968, 's:resolutions'),
