  ('sweep', 'sweep', 'swi:p', E'n. 扫除, 打扫, 肃清, 视野, 范围, 全胜\nvt. 扫除, 掸去, 猛拉, 扫荡, 肃清, 冲走, 刮起, 环视, 掠过, 扫射\nvi. 扫, 打扫, 袭击, 席卷, 扫视, 掠过', E'n. a wide scope\nn. a long oar used in an open boat\nn. a movement in an arc\nv. move with sweeping, effortless, gliding motions', '', 3, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 2636, 2639, 'd:swept/p:swept/i:sweeping/3:sweeps/s:sweeps'),
  ('stable', 'stable', '''steibl', E'n. 马房, 牛棚\na. 稳定的, 安定的, 坚固的, 坚定的\nvt. 赶入马房\nvi. 被关在马厩', E'n. a farm building for housing horses or other livestock\nv. shelter in a stable\na. resistant to change of position or condition\ns. firm and dependable; subject to little fluctuation', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 2637, 2903, 's:stables/p:stabled/d:stabled/i:stabling/3:stables'),
