  ('burden', 'burden', '''bә:dn', E'n. 负担, 重载, 担子, 责任\nvt. 装货于, 烦扰, 使负担', E'n. an onerous or difficult concern\nn. the central idea that is expanded in a document or discourse\nv. weight down with a load', '', 3, false, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl}', 2696, 2665, 's:burdens/d:burdened/i:burdening/p:burdened/3:burdens'),
