  ('enthusiasm', 'enthusiasm', 'in''θju:ziæzәm', 'n. 巨大的热情, 热心', E'n. a feeling of excitement\nn. a lively interest', '', 3, true, '{cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 2678, 3716, 's:enthusiasms'),
