  ('frequent', 'frequent', '''fri:kwәnt', E'a. 时常发生的, 频繁的, 快速的\nvt. 时常来访, 常常聚集, 常与...交往', E'v. be a regular or frequent visitor to a certain place\na. coming at short intervals or habitually\ns. frequently encountered;', '', 4, true, '{gk,cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts,gre}', 3109, 3272, 'd:frequented/p:frequented/i:frequenting/3:frequents'),
