  ('dean', 'dean', 'di:n', E'n. 院长, 主持牧师\n[法] 外交团长, 学院院长, 教务长', E'n. an administrator in charge of a division of a university or college\nn. United States film actor whose moody rebellious roles made him a cult figure (1931-1955)\nn. a man who is the senior member of a group\nn. (Roman Catholic Church) the head of the College of Cardinals', '', 1, false, '{cet6,ky,ielts}', 3709, 4946, 's:deans'),
