  ('probability', 'probability', '.prɒbә''biliti', E'n. 可能性, 或然率, 几率, 概率\n[化] 概率; 几率', E'n. a measure of how likely it is that some event will occur; a number expressing the ratio of favorable cases to the whole number of cases possible\nn. the quality of being probable; a probable event or the most probable event', '', 1, false, '{cet4,cet6,ky}', 3717, 5104, 's:probabilities'),
