  ('sympathetic', 'sympathetic', '.simpә''θetik', E'a. 有同情心的, 合意的, 赞成的\nn. 交感神经, 容易感受的人', E'a. of or relating to the sympathetic nervous system\na. expressing or feeling or resulting from sympathy or compassion or friendly fellow feelings; disposed toward\na. (of characters in literature or drama) evoking empathic or sympathetic feelings\ns. having similar disposition and tastes', '', 2, true, '{cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts}', 4279, 5209, ''),
