  ('distress', 'distress', 'di''stres', E'n. 苦恼, 贫困, 痛苦\nvt. 使苦恼\na. 亏本出售的', E'n. psychological suffering\nn. a state of adversity (danger or affliction or need)\nn. extreme physical pain\nn. the seizure and holding of property as security for payment of a debt or satisfaction of a claim', '', 2, false, '{cet4,cet6,ky,toefl,ielts,gre}', 4287, 5194, 'd:distressed/p:distressed/s:distresses/i:distressing/3:distresses'),
