  ('penny', 'penny', '''peni', E'n. 便士, 一分, 小钱, 点滴\n[经] 便士', E'n. a fractional monetary unit of Ireland and the United Kingdom; equal to one hundredth of a pound\nn. a coin worth one-hundredth of the value of the basic unit', '', 3, true, '{zk,gk,cet4,cet6,ky,ielts}', 4306, null, 's:pennies'),
