  ('scramble', 'scramble', '''skræmbl', E'n. 攀缘, 爬行, 抢夺, 混乱, 紧急起飞\nvi. 攀缘, 杂乱蔓延, 争夺, 拼凑, 匆忙\nvt. 攀登, 扰乱, 使混杂', E'n. an unceremonious and disorganized struggle\nv. to move hurriedly\nv. bring into random order\nv. make unintelligible', '', 2, false, '{cet6,ky,toefl,gre}', 6181, 4326, 'p:scrambled/i:scrambling/d:scrambled/3:scrambles/s:scrambles'),
