  ('odor', 'odor', '''әudә', E'n. 气味, 香味, 名声, 意味\n[医] 气味', E'n any property detected by the olfactory system\nn the sensation that results when olfactory receptors in the nose are stimulated by particular chemicals in gaseous form', '', 0, false, '{cet6,ky,toefl}', null, 5311, 's:odors'),
