  ('lottery', 'lottery', '''lɒtәri', E'n. 奖券, 彩票, 运气\n[经] 抽彩给奖法', E'n. something that is regarded as a chance event\nn. players buy (or are given) chances and prizes are distributed by casting lots', '', 1, false, '{ky,toefl,ielts,gre}', 10483, 6027, 's:lotteries'),
