  ('nominal', 'nominal', '''nɒminl', E'a. 名义上的, 名字的, 有名无实的, 稍许的\nn. 名词性词', E'a. relating to or constituting or bearing or giving a name\ns. insignificantly small; a matter of form only (`tokenish'' is informal)\na. pertaining to a noun or to a word group that functions as a noun\na. of, relating to, or characteristic of an amount that is not adjusted for inflation', '', 2, false, '{cet6,ky,ielts,gre}', 6079, 10783, 's:nominals'),
